    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;VIRTUAL ASSISTANT (VA)&quot;" target="&quot;AMAZON&quot;">
      <data key="d3">14.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Virtual Assistant (VA) works for Amazon businesses, suggesting a service provider-client relationship."</data>
